    "ag08-s2-same-string-continuity"
  ],
  "strengths": [
    "uses the accepted AG01 R3 steel-string, bridge and body rendering path",
    "keeps one persistent rendered buffer per resolved physical string",
    "carries the actual residual same-string waveform continuously across a re-attack boundary and damps that prior state instead of allowing independent same-string tails to overlap indefinitely",
    "leaves shared bridge/body memory, sympathetic cross-string coupling and AG07 action-state coupling for later AG08 slices"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "AG08-S2 activates same-string note continuity only; tracks containing instrument actions still delegate to the canonical AG07 event path",
    "shared bridge/body memory, sympathetic cross-string coupling and multi-technique transition state are not active yet",
    "generic project-authored state dimensions are not a measured or named-instrument response"
  ],
  "recommended_roles": [
